.TH REGOLITH-DISPLAYD-INIT 1 "August 2026" "regolith-displayd 0.3.4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
regolith-displayd-init \- initialise the Regolith Kanshi configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B regolith-displayd-init
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B regolith-displayd-init
creates the Regolith Kanshi configuration directory and an include file for
profile snippets when they do not already exist.  If the profile directory is
empty, it creates a harmless empty profile so Kanshi can start cleanly.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B REGOLITH_KANSHI_DIR
Use this directory instead of
.IR ~/.config/regolith3/kanshi .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR regolith-displayd (1)
.SH AUTHOR
The regolith-displayd contributors.
